{"comment_text": {"ja24:0.1": "", "ja24:0.2": "", "ja24:0.3": "", "ja24:0.4": "", "ja24:1.1": "Similar to the previous story, a warhorse declares its determination to go on. ", "ja24:1.2": "", "ja24:1.3": "", "ja24:1.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Vāḷavā</i> is masculine nominative plural (commentary: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>khaḷuṅkassā hāyanti</i>). It is a secondary derivation, glossed with <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vaḷavasaṅkhātā</i>, “reckoned as a mare”; cf. Sanskrit <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vāḍaba</i>. ", "ja24:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja24:0.1": "<article id='ja24'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja24:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja24:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja24:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja24:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja24:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja24:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja24:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja24:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja24:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja24:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja24:0.3": "Kuruṅgavagga ", "ja24:0.4": "4. Ājaññajātaka ", "ja24:1.1": "“Yadā yadā yattha yadā, ", "ja24:1.2": "yattha yattha yadā yadā; ", "ja24:1.3": "Ājañño kurute vegaṁ, ", "ja24:1.4": "hāyanti tattha vāḷavā”ti. ", "ja24:2.1": "Ājaññajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja24:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 24 ", "ja24:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja24:0.3": "The Four-horned Antelope ", "ja24:0.4": "The Thoroughbred: a past life story ", "ja24:1.1": "Whenever whenever, wherever whenever, ", "ja24:1.2": "wherever wherever, whenever whenever: ", "ja24:1.3": "the thoroughbred drives onward, ", "ja24:1.4": "while the geldings fade right there. ", "ja24:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja24:0.1": "", "ja24:0.2": "", "ja24:0.3": "", "ja24:0.4": "", "ja24:1.1": "ms22J_52, msdiv24, pts-vp-pli1.181", "ja24:1.2": "", "ja24:1.3": "", "ja24:1.4": "", "ja24:2.1": "ms22J_53"}, "keys_order": ["ja24:0.1", "ja24:0.2", "ja24:0.3", "ja24:0.4", "ja24:1.1", "ja24:1.2", "ja24:1.3", "ja24:1.4", "ja24:2.1"]}